N5008 [dcl.fct.def.default]/5: the access check of the implicitly-defined
body treated only implicitly-declared special members as members of their
class ("member 'plain::s' is not accessible (private)").  g++ 13 and
clang++ 18 accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
